  - localizationKey: GAMEPLAY_Shotgun_PartBarrelDescription
    languages:
      English: A pair of 12-gauge barrels, cold enough to burn bare skin. Pitted
        near the muzzles but still straight down their length. On their own they're
        just pipes. At a workbench, with the rest of the gun, they could fire again.
      German: 
      Russian: 
      French: 
      Japanese: 
      Korean: 
      SimplifiedChinese: 
      Swedish: 
      TraditionalChinese: 
      Turkish: 
      Norwegian: 
      Spanish: 
      PortuguesePortugal: 
