  - localizationKey: GAMEPLAY_Shotgun_PartStockDescription
    languages:
      English: A hardwood stock, the finish worn pale where a cheek rested through
        years of autumn hunts. Someone scratched initials into the grip. One of five
        parts needed to rebuild a shotgun at a workbench.
      German: 
      Russian: 
      French: 
      Japanese: 
      Korean: 
      SimplifiedChinese: 
      Swedish: 
      TraditionalChinese: 
      Turkish: 
      Norwegian: 
      Spanish: 
      PortuguesePortugal: 
      PortugueseBrazil: 
      Dutch: 
      Finnish: 
      Italian: 
      Polish: 
      Ukrainian: 
