      Polish: 
      Ukrainian: 
  - localizationKey: GAMEPLAY_Shotgun_PartTriggerDescription
    languages:
      English: Trigger, sear and guard, packed in an old tobacco tin by someone who
        meant to come back for them. One of five parts needed to rebuild a shotgun
        at a workbench.
      German: 
      Russian: 
      French: 
      Japanese: 
      Korean: 
      SimplifiedChinese: 
      Swedish: 
      TraditionalChinese: 
