      Polish: 
      Ukrainian: 
  - localizationKey: GAMEPLAY_Shotgun_SkillTier5Benefits
    languages:
      English: 'Fastest reloading, aiming and equipping

        No recoil kick

        Steadiest
        recovery after each shot

        Unload and load both barrels quickly

        Keep
        the unspent shell when switching ammo

        Close the breech while raising
        the gun to aim

        Very high critical hit chance'
